            "review_title": "Review at Cherry BBQ",
            "review_text": "Langwhang69\nAl Ain, United Arab Emirates196 contributions\n1\nNew Gem\nJul 2025 • Family\nWow, a refreshing new restaurant in Danang, light and area modern and good to follow that. \n\nWe opted for the beef belly, pork belly, prawns and lots of different bits and pieces. \n\nFood perfect and option to have the staff cook or for you. We opted to cook ourself and really enjoyed.\n\nAfter eating owner came and joined us to ask for feedback, heat fun a few SOJU later and we laughed despite a slight language barrier, google translate is an amazing thing, \n\nHuge shout out to our server Tran Dong Thuat looked after us from start to finish, next time in Danang I will be back. \n\nThank you to you all x\nRead more\nWritten July 25, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
